    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48438" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tītillātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				tickling</i>, <i>titillation</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">voluptates, quibus quasi titillatic sensibus
					adhibetur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 1, 40, 113</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non est voluptatum tanta quasi titillatio in
					senibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Sen. 14, 47</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 52, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corporis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 92, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
